  "synopsis": [
    {
      "langue": "en",
      "text": "The first (and possibly only) sauna game for the NES! Take part in the traditional Finnish midsummer activity of Juhannussauna (midsummer sauna).You control Sauna dude who's heaten up his sauna to 200 degrees celsius (that's 392 degrees fahrenheit!) and celebrates midsummer by sitting in the löyly like there's no tomorrow. Accompanied with a six-pack of beer, your task is to stay in the sauna for as long as possible and rack up your sauna score.Please note that the game language is only in Finnish."
    }
  ],
